===Etymology 1===
From {{proto|Germanic|gabulan|tribute|lang=ang}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|ghab(h)-||gheb(h)-|to take, give, transfer|lang=ang}}. Cognate with {{etyl|non|-}} {{term|gǫfga||to worship, offer|lang=non|sc=Latinx}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐌲𐌰𐌱𐌴𐌹||tr=gabei|riches|lang=got}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|habeo|habeō|to own, possess, have|lang=la}}. More at {{l|en|give}}.

